Shared utilities in this repository — cassette replay, invariant checks, JSON
traces, structured logging, and the secret scanner — are small vendored helpers.
The same helpers are maintained in parallel across the portfolio repositories
and kept aligned. The ticket-triage golden set, the go/no-go policy, the canary
simulator, and the deprecation calendar belong to this repository.

All data in this tree is synthetic. Casa Brisa and Aerolito Data are fictional. Money figures are [EST] or simulated.

See docs/PROVENANCE.md.
